ts","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"YctRrEphHLkA4fOTBNa2qQ","review_id":"mdwIletZT1oO-a2pV1_j8Q","date":"2018-07-11T22:46:41","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9295080304145813,"text_excerpt":"Greaaaaaat whole in a wall..... hidden gem. I love their tacos and pairings. It's like you can have a street taco or upgrade it with some styles on it. I feel like you should try them all. The menu is small and perfect for quick lunch or late night bar with a friend. It's definitely one of those that you walk right by it and thought nothing but when you eat and drink you are awed. Also the staff is very funny and attentive and down to earth. Also very clean place could also come here for a hidden small date out of the big places."},{"business_id":"YctRrEphHLkA4fOTBNa2qQ","review_id":"uJyy2AlQ-20IvBfS6LSjPA","date":"2018-09-04T21:29:27","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9080062508583069,"text_excerpt":"Arianne (\"ari-on\", silent e) offers nice vegetarian options. I'm still not entirely sure what the hash-like mixture in their veggie taco is, but it tastes good, and their tofu and black bean tacos all put on a worthy competition for best in show. All of them were hearty and tasty, though they did overdo the citrus note from what tasted like limes. Their taco Tuesday deals are cheap and well worth coming for. Even on another day, it isn't a bad option as it has a nice location, fits most diets, and is fast and good. They have a dining room and bar stuffed into a rather skinny space, which gets crowded easily during events and peak hours."},{"business_id":"YctRrEphHLkA4fOTBNa2qQ","review_id":"i5iZdQ9F6TA_d8iBPhKZRg","date":"2017-11-06T02:44:04","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.8852774500846863,"text_excerpt":"This is a cool spot. It just a nice place to chill and hang. Along with that comes great device, awesome drinks and really great food. The Margaritas were just right. You must have the Patseles. Poked well and tasty."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"YctRrEphHLkA4fOTBNa2qQ","photo_id":"aDius5U9XN7LkGzC1IIuww","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/aDius5U9XN7LkGzC1IIuww.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8517463803291321},{"business_id":"YctRrEphHLkA4fOTBNa2qQ","photo_id":"DvrKTNaN1JoyAr7zMr3w4Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/DvrKTNaN1JoyAr7zMr3w4Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8517463207244873}]},"notebook_case":null}
